  <!-- ============================================================
       メガネウラ (Meganeura) - 水辺を飛び回る古代種の巨大トンボ。
       特殊能力: 移動が速い(飛行)、小型・脆弱 / 妊娠条件: 卵生
       ============================================================ -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>JP_Meganeura</defName>
    <label>meganeura</label>
    <description>翼を広げると人の腕ほどにもなる、古代種の巨大なトンボ。水辺を素早く飛び回り、小さな獲物を捕らえる。体は小さく脆いが、その速さゆえに捕えるのは難しい。卵で殖える。\n\nA giant ancient dragonfly whose wingspan can rival a person's arm. It darts swiftly over wetlands, snatching small prey. Small and fragile, but its speed makes it hard to catch. Reproduces by laying eggs.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>6.5</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>0</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>45</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <Wildness>0.96</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <race>
      <body>QuadrupedAnimalWithPawsAndTail</body>
      <baseBodySize>0.3</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>0.4</baseHealthScale>
      <baseHungerRate>0.3</baseHungerRate>
      <foodType>OmnivoreRoughAnimal</foodType>
      <predator>false</predator>
      <leatherDef>JP_Chitin_Ancient</leatherDef>
      <useMeatFrom>Megaspider</useMeatFrom>
      <manhunterOnDamageChance>0.35</manhunterOnDamageChance>
      <manhunterOnTameFailChance>0.12</manhunterOnTameFailChance>
      <trainability>Intermediate</trainability>
      <herdAnimal>false</herdAnimal>
      <canBePredatorPrey>true</canBePredatorPrey>
      <hasGenders>true</hasGenders>
      <gestationPeriodDays>3</gestationPeriodDays>
